Locate the sun wherever you are on Earth, anytime, by any weather.

Find out what the sun path is any date, any location on Earth with an intuitive interface.

Supports augmented reality (AR) and widgets.

Use this app to:
• plan your next sunset photo or sunrise photo;
• find the time the sun illuminates a specific side of a building (for a photo shoot);
• estimate sun exposure when looking for a new property;
• which side of the hotel your room should be for your next holidays;
• learn more about the sun path in the sky and seasons;
• study archaeoastronomical sites and sun-aligned artefacts;
• customise your iPhone or iPad screen with widgets.

App features:
• Augmented reality (AR);
• interactive plot and map;
• sunrise and sunset times;
• Save locations for bookmark and to configure widgets;
• summer solstice and winter solstice;
• time zones and daylight saving time;
• easy sharing: save and send the sun path plot and the map, along with essential information (sunrise, sunset, and link to map);
• location lookup by coordinates, reverse geocoding, or name;
• curated list of sun-aligned artefacts, archaeoastronomical sites;
• multiple windows in iPadOS: view different sites at the same time.

Interactive plot and map:
• swipe up and down on the plot to change the time of day, or the date;
• swipe on the map to change the coordinates;
• tap on the date to change mode (date or time);
• long press on date to input specific date or choose time zone.

Note: Never look at the sun without proper protection.

Roofing and Framing carpentry Calculator.
Developed by carpenters and used by master carpenters, contractors, builders and other construction professionals around the world.
An indispensable roof tool for roofing construction.

Easy to use - no complex steps to remember.
Set default values for the most commonly used values.

Metric and imperial at the touch of a button.

CALCULATIONS INCLUDE :
Hipped, gabled and single-pitch roofs:
◆ Lengths ;
◆ Angles;
◆ Heights;
◆ layout;
◆ Birdsmouth
◆ Pitch (various);
◆ Roof Pitch Factor;
◆ Adjust calculations for a plate higher on one side;
◆ Roof surfaces ;
◆ Stud Wall Calculations & Estimating ;
◆ Other timber layouts ;
◆ Roof surfaces ;

ALSO:-
◆Easy-to-use standard calculator - common functions for quick calculation.
◆ Quick converter - lengths, areas, volumes: Metric and US/Imperial
◆ Print, email or message lists and even take notes on the first ;

Optimised for all iPhones and iPads running IOS16.4+ in portrait mode.

INFOGUIDE :
Infoguide is part of a small construction company based in Western Australia and this app was created by a former carpenter for our team of carpenters. We use it and believe it will be as useful to other carpenters as it has been to us.
